    4, 2005  R.OKAFOR\t\t\tCLOCK-OUT 16:55   <NOTE: EARLY DEPARTURE, NO REASON LOGGED>\n...\nOct
    6, 2005  J.ANSELM\t\t\tCLOCK-IN  05:58\nOct 6, 2005  J.ANSELM\t\t\tSECTOR-D 
    ACCESS GRANTED   06:20\nOct 6, 2005  J.ANSELM\t\t\tCLOCK-OUT 23:47\n...\nOct
